{"id":"658924","name":"红烧太阳鱼","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658924/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"太阳鱼","amount":"2条"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"一块"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"一头"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"两根"},{"name":"金不换","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"太阳鱼，摊主已帮忙处理好，清洗干净后用盐腌入底味，烹饪前需洗去咸味。","img":"images/658924/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"配料：姜丝、蒜、葱、金不换。","img":"images/658924/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅热油，鱼入锅煎。","img":"images/658924/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煎至一面金黄后翻面。","img":"images/658924/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入姜蒜煎香。","img":"images/658924/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入适量的清水，加入酱油、老抽、豆瓣酱、胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/658924/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"焖五六分钟后开盖。","img":"images/658924/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入葱和金不换增香，拌匀出锅。","img":"images/658924/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658924/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}